              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "प्रस्ताव (prastāv) is a tatsama, borrowed from Sanskrit prastāva, \"an introduction; the subject of a talk\" (Monier-Williams). Monier-Williams does not give the sense of a formal proposal, which is usually taken as a modern Hindi one."
