              "text": "ठहराना — ṭhahrānā — \"to hold to be, to declare (guilty, responsible)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "लोगों ने सरकार को ज़िम्मेदार ठहराया। logoṁ ne sarkār ko zimmedār ṭhahrāyā. People held the government responsible."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with ने (he or she …): उसने मुझे दोषी ठहराया, usne mujhe doṣī ṭhahrāyā."
            }
          ]
        },
