          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ठहराना (ṭhahrānā) is the causative of ठहरना, \"to stop, to settle\", which CDIAL traces to a reconstructed stabhira (CDIAL 13680): to make a judgement settle on someone."
